TWEAK_NAME="Order audio sources"
TWEAK_RISK="medium"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Appends a guarded wrapper to /jci/gui/apps/system/js/systemApp.js so the entertainment source list is rebuilt with the preferred sources first, keeping the stock relative order of the rest. Set OPENCMU_AUDIO_ORDER to a comma-separated list of stock source IDs; at least one ID is required. Stock 74.00.324 IDs: TrafficInfo, FMRadio, AMRadio, DAB, SatRadio, XmAudio, AhaRadio, Pandora, Stitcher, BTAudio, CarPlayWifi, CarPlay, AndroidAuto, USB_A, USB_B, CD, AuxIn, DVD, TV. It only reorders the visible list; it never selects a source."
